        <p class="text-2xl font-medium text-gray-900 mb-8 italic">
          The best hose nozzle is the one that does not leak and does not make your hand ache. For most people that means a fireman-style handle or a thumb-control valve rather than a squeeze trigger. Patterns matter far less than the label suggests, because almost everyone uses three: a gentle shower, a jet and something in between.
